      "caption": "Cost-quality frontier for individual-judge deployment strategies. The horizontal axis carries the relative costs of Table~\\ref{tab:deployment} on a log scale; the vertical axis is schematic and encodes the ordering argued in this appendix rather than measured accuracies. Cascade and speculative judging sit near the knee of the frontier; self-consistency lies below it because it reduces variance without adding discriminative signal. Marker color encodes the strategy family.",
